<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n34793" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐναλ-είφω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>anoint with</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τί τινι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Morb.</u>
					2.36
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀφθαλμοί ὀστρείψ ἐναληλιμμένοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					420c
				</span></i>
			:—
				Med.
			, <i>anoint onself,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				AP
				11.112
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Nicarch.
			</span></i>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. τάς ῥῖνας</span>
			<i>one's</i> nose, <i><span class="en">
				Alex.
				190
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν κόμην φαρμάκψ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.771b
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὼ ὀφθαλμώ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hld.
					7.14
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>paint within</i> outlines, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπογράψαντες ταῖς γραμμαῖς οὕτως
					ἐναλείφουσι τοῖς Χρώμασι τὸ ζῷον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>GA</u>
					743b24
				</span></i>
			: generally, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Χύδην ἐ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Po.</u>
					1450b1
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ἐναλειφθέν</span>
			<i>coat of stucco</i>, interpol.in <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>GA</u>
				726b27
			</span></i>.</div>
